  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Damage to regional energy infrastructure increases reliance on seaborne fuel imports and rerouted exports, prompting states and navies to introduce convoying, port prioritization and corridor controls to secure shipments.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
