  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Damage to energy production and distribution reduces exportable energy volumes and/or raises import bills and fiscal support needs for the affected country, worsening the current account and driving near‑term currency depreciation.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
  <data key="d39">currency_activism</data>
</edge>
