  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Damage to energy infrastructure disrupts fuel and power supplies and raises operational costs, forcing postponement or derating of fabs and data‑center expansions that produce and host specialized AI hardware, thereby reducing near‑term hardware throughput.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
