  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid depletion of interceptors forces allied partners to prioritize resupply and allocation decisions, producing disputes and unequal burden‑sharing that erode operational and political alignment.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
