  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained political commitment to supply weapons drives direct increases in defense R&amp;D budgets and procurement orders that channel public and private capital into AI-enabled defense projects and startups, raising overall AI investment flow.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
