  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in measured maritime security risk (attacks, mines, seizures) triggers rapid portfolio reallocation and withdrawal of foreign bank lines and investment from exposed littoral markets, immediately reducing gross and net cross-border capital inflows.</data>
