  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster fielding of AI‑enabled ISR, unmanned surface/undersea systems and automated decision aids by state and proxy actors raises the probability of misidentification, collision, or automated escalation in the congested Hormuz environment, increasing maritime security risk.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_hormuz_standoff</data>
