<edge source="currency_activism::rate_expectation_curve" target="alliance_munitions_strai::alliance_cohesion" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained upward revision to the market‑implied policy‑rate path in a major currency raises projected borrowing and procurement costs for partner states, creating domestic fiscal stress and political disputes over burden sharing that erode policy alignment within alliances.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_activism</data>
  <data key="d39">alliance_munitions_strai</data>
