  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.82</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in market-implied future short-term rates raises discount rates and financing costs for venture and corporate capital, directly reducing the pace and size of AI funding rounds and corporate R&amp;D allocations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_activism</data>
